          <li>Baymard Institute, <a href="https://baymard.com/lists/cart-abandonment-rate" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cart Abandonment Rate</a>, 2025 (about 70% average; 19% abandon over forced account creation).</li>
          <li>Intuit QuickBooks, <a href="https://quickbooks.intuit.com/r/small-business-data/small-business-late-payments-report-2025/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Small Business Late Payments Report</a>, 2025 (vendor survey; 56% owed money on unpaid invoices).</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-bae-border-light text-sm text-bae-muted">Jump into the tools: <a href="/finance-toolkit/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Finance Toolkit</a>, <a href="/tools/bank-statement-to-excel/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Bank Statement to Excel</a>, <a href="/tools/bank-statement-analyzer/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Bank Statement Analyzer</a>, <a href="/calculators/mortgage-calculator/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Mortgage Calculator</a>, <a href="/tools/invoice-generator/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">Invoice Generator</a>, and <a href="/tools/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">all Tools</a>.</p>
